# Decoded working copies of real voice recordings. Never committed: AGENTS.md,
# "no real audio, voiceprints or held-out evaluation data in the repo". The root
# .gitignore already excludes *.wav; this excludes the whole cache directory so a
# future format cannot leak through it.
canonical/

# Replayed captures for the channel transplant. Same rule, and these are recordings
# of a real acoustic path. The conditions file is metadata, not audio, and the
# controls must travel with the repo or the deltas cannot be read later.
# Excludes everything under replay/ recursively, then re-admits directories so git
# descends into them, then the conditions files. Without the directory rule git
# never looks inside an excluded folder and the negation cannot take effect.
replay/**
!replay/**/
!replay/**/capture_conditions.json

# Everything else here is a CSV of measurements, and those are the point.
!results/
!results/*.csv
